This can be hacked by accessing the node structure blindly, then take advantage of the fact that the script list shows the path of files as its item tooltip.

```gdscript
var se := EditorInterface.get_script_editor()
var il: ItemList = se.get_child(0).get_child(1).get_child(0).get_child(0).get_child(1)
var selected := il.get_selected_items()
if not selected:
    print("Nothing selected")
    return
var index := selected[0]
print(il.get_item_tooltip(index))
```

It works but it's a hack.
